WEBVTT

00:05:59.436 --> 00:06:01.076
EK: That would be a good question.

00:06:01.756 --> 00:06:06.916
So adopting a plant-based diet
with supplements

00:06:06.956 --> 00:06:10.676
may help shrink
a person's carbon footprint

00:06:10.676 --> 00:06:13.076
in high-income countries like the US.

00:06:13.436 --> 00:06:17.116
But, you know, a lot of people
are not going to do that.

00:06:17.756 --> 00:06:20.036
And for the rest of the world,

00:06:20.076 --> 00:06:24.836
these foods are needed
to provide key nutrients,

00:06:24.876 --> 00:06:27.756
such as vitamin B12 and vitamin A,

00:06:27.796 --> 00:06:30.996
which are critical for brain function,